AIDFLOW
Resilient Aid Logistics
Product, UX, Architecture & Omnirush Build Blueprint
Vibe-A-Thon • Social Impact & Civic Micro-Logistics
A practical, implementation-ready plan for a six-hour prototype focused on keeping perishable aid moving when reservations fail, destinations change, or delivery becomes infeasible.

PRODUCT PROMISE
