Test group	Minimum acceptance cases
Dispatch	Large batch splits across riders; no over-capacity; no over-demand; expired batch blocked; infeasible ETA blocked.
Compatibility	Wrong category blocked; missing clean water/fuel requirement blocked; closed shelter blocked.
Reservation lease	Unacknowledged reservation expires; stock releases once; repeated timeout has no duplicate effect.
Cargo custody	Picked-up/in-transit stock is not returned to donor pool; delivery is immutable; handover is explicit.
