Final recommendation
BUILD THE PROOF, NOT THE PROMISE
In a six-hour sprint, AidFlow should win attention through a coherent interface and a reliable, observable recovery mechanism. Protect the dispatch rules, cargo ledger, simulation controls, and tests. Treat every other feature as optional until those are working.

